    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30510" root="عمد" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعْمُودٌ</span></b>  applied to a thing that presses heavily,
such as a roof, <i>Held</i> [<i>up,</i> or <i>supported,</i>] <i>by
columns:</i> differing from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَدْعُومٌ</span> [q. v.]. (TA in
art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دعم</span>.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also A person <i>resorted to</i> in cases
of need. (A.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَمِيدٌ</span>, in two places.

